README (English)
--------------------------------

This directory contains sub-directories to provide tools or documentation for developers.

Note: All files in this directory are in the source repository only and are not provided with a standard release. They are useless to make OnLi working.

You may find a more complete documentation on OnLi on the wiki:

https://wiki.OnLi.org/

and on

https://doxygen.OnLi.org/
